Not linked into ~/.claude/skills/ by default, and /sync-config leaves it alone.

This skill does a job that happens once per machine — installing (or uninstalling) the scheduled
machine-health agent and the root fseventsd watchdog. It is reached by argument instead:

  /dev-tools machine-health

dev-tools/ holds a symlink to this directory. Read dev-tools/SKILL.md for the dispatch table.
